# Copy to .env and edit. Every setting is optional.

# Where the checkpoint (~20 GB) and, in Spark mode, the overlay (2.9 GB) live.
# Default: $HOME/models/sparkinkling.
#MODEL_ROOT=/srv/models/sparkinkling

# strict (the default) serves the checkpoint as shipped. spark adds the
# calibrated NVFP4 overlay for decode. See docs/MODES.md.
#MODE=strict

# A profile in install/profiles/ (default, max or saver) or a JSON file of
# your own. See README.md, "Profiles".
#PROFILE=default

# Utilization override (two decimals, 0.50-0.90). Default: the profile's.
# GB10 memory is shared with the host; leave room for everything else it runs.
#GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.80

# dflash2 (the default) runs incoai's DFlash2 drafter for Inkling 2 Mini while
# it pays; dspark the checkpoint's bundled DSpark drafter; none decodes plainly.
#DRAFTER=dflash2

# Keep the prefix cache's evicted KV blocks on this disk and read them back
# when a conversation returns. GiB, 16-100 (default 48). Off unless set.
#PREFIX_CACHE_DIR=/srv/sparkinkling/prefix-cache
#PREFIX_CACHE_GB=48

# start.sh pulls ghcr.io/enntity/atlas-sparkinkling:<install tree> for this
# checkout and builds from source if that tag is not published. PULL=0 always
# builds from source.
#PULL=0
# Parallel compile jobs for a source build; lower it if the build runs out of memory.
#ATLAS_BUILD_JOBS=4

# Only for private Hugging Face mirrors; the pinned checkpoint is public.
#HF_TOKEN=

# Tool-call guard: stream (default) holds each call until it passes, and streams
# the arguments of a request that sends stream_tool_arguments: true, checking
# its calls when they end; on always holds; off.
#TOOL_GUARD=stream
#TOOL_GUARD_ALLOW_HOSTS=uploads.example.org
#TOOL_GUARD_DENY_HOSTS=blocked.example.org
#TOOL_GUARD_MAX_BYTES=1048576
